  "description": "Asil, a poor noble, enters the academy as the top student, determined to restore his family’s honor. Instead, he becomes the target of relentless bullying. Seeking justice, he confronts Valery, only to face an even harsher fate. Reduced to Valery’s pawn and isolated from everyone, Asil searches desperately for a way out. But Valery’s growing obsession only tightens the chains around him.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
